*> K-means, agglomerative and DBSCAN clustering of iris, scored by species purity.
*> Run with `just run-cobol TARGET=clustering_ex`.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLUSTERING-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

01 FEATURE-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC X(12) VALUE "Sepal.Length".
   05 FILLER PIC X(12) VALUE "Sepal.Width".
   05 FILLER PIC X(12) VALUE "Petal.Length".
   05 FILLER PIC X(12) VALUE "Petal.Width".
01 FEATURE-NAMES REDEFINES FEATURE-DATA.
   05 FEATURE-NAME PIC X(12) OCCURS 4.
01 LINKAGE-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC X(8) VALUE "ward".
   05 FILLER PIC X(8) VALUE "complete".
   05 FILLER PIC X(8) VALUE "average".
01 LINKAGE-NAMES REDEFINES LINKAGE-DATA.
   05 LINKAGE-NAME PIC X(8) OCCURS 3.

01 IRIS      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FEATURES  USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MODEL     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 LABELS-VEC USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 N-ROWS    USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 I         USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 J         USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 K         USAGE BINARY-LONG.

*> Each row's species, as an index into SPECIES-NAME.
01 SPECIES-COUNT USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
01 SPECIES-NAME PIC X(32) OCCURS 10.
01 ROW-SPECIES USAGE BINARY-LONG OCCURS 1000.

*> REPORT-PURITY input: a cluster label per row (-1 for noise) and the cluster count.
01 ROW-LABEL USAGE BINARY-LONG OCCURS 1000.
01 N-CLUSTERS USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 VOTES.
   05 VOTE-CLUSTER OCCURS 50.
      10 VOTE USAGE BINARY-LONG OCCURS 10.
01 CLUSTER   USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 TOTAL     USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 BEST      USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 BEST-SPECIES USAGE BINARY-LONG.

*> Number formatting.
01 INT-1     PIC -(9)9.
01 INT-2     PIC -(9)9.
01 INT-3     PIC -(9)9.
01 NUM       USAGE COMP-2.
01 NUM-EDIT  PIC -(12)9.9(10).
01 NUM-TEXT  PIC X(32).
01 NUM-LEN   USAGE BINARY-LONG.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_frame_iris" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    PERFORM READ-SPECIES

    MOVE 4 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 4
        MOVE FEATURE-NAME(I) TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(I)
        MOVE -1 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM-LENGTH(I)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_vector_string_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF TO FEATURES

    DISPLAY "=================== K-means (k=3) on iris ==================="
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-K-MEANS-NEW-DATA
    MOVE FEATURES TO DM-K-MEANS-NEW-FEATURE-COLUMNS
    MOVE 3 TO DM-K-MEANS-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE 3 TO DM-K-MEANS-NEW-N-CLUSTERS
    CALL "dm_k_means_new" USING DM-K-MEANS-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-K-MEANS-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-K-MEANS-INERTIA-SELF
    CALL "dm_k_means_inertia" USING DM-K-MEANS-INERTIA DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-K-MEANS-INERTIA-RESULT TO NUM
    PERFORM FORMAT-NUMBER
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-K-MEANS-ITERATIONS-USED-SELF
    CALL "dm_k_means_iterations_used" USING DM-K-MEANS-ITERATIONS-USED DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-K-MEANS-ITERATIONS-USED-RESULT TO INT-1
    DISPLAY "Inertia: " NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN) ", iterations (best run): " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-1)
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-K-MEANS-LABELS-SELF
    CALL "dm_k_means_labels" USING DM-K-MEANS-LABELS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-K-MEANS-LABELS-RESULT TO LABELS-VEC
    PERFORM READ-ULONG-LABELS
    MOVE 3 TO N-CLUSTERS
    PERFORM REPORT-PURITY
    PERFORM CLOSE-MODEL

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Agglomerative clustering on iris ==================="
    PERFORM VARYING K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL K > 3
        MOVE LINKAGE-NAME(K) TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-LINKAGE
        PERFORM NEW-AGGLOMERATIVE
        DISPLAY "--- linkage=" FUNCTION TRIM(LINKAGE-NAME(K)) " ---"
        MOVE MODEL TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-LABELS-SELF
        CALL "dm_agglomerative_clustering_labels" USING DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-LABELS DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-LABELS-RESULT TO LABELS-VEC
        PERFORM READ-ULONG-LABELS
        MOVE 3 TO N-CLUSTERS
        PERFORM REPORT-PURITY
        PERFORM CLOSE-MODEL
    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "--- Re-cutting the ward dendrogram at k=2 without refitting ---"
    MOVE "ward" TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-LINKAGE
    PERFORM NEW-AGGLOMERATIVE
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-CUT-SELF
    MOVE 2 TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-CUT-N-CLUSTERS
    CALL "dm_agglomerative_clustering_cut" USING DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-CUT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-CUT-RESULT TO LABELS-VEC
    PERFORM READ-ULONG-LABELS
    MOVE 2 TO N-CLUSTERS
    PERFORM REPORT-PURITY
    PERFORM CLOSE-MODEL

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== DBSCAN on iris ==================="
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DBSCAN-NEW-DATA
    MOVE FEATURES TO DM-DBSCAN-NEW-FEATURE-COLUMNS
    MOVE 4 TO DM-DBSCAN-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE 0.6 TO DM-DBSCAN-NEW-EPS
    MOVE 5 TO DM-DBSCAN-NEW-MIN-SAMPLES
    CALL "dm_dbscan_new" USING DM-DBSCAN-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DBSCAN-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-DBSCAN-N-CLUSTERS-SELF
    CALL "dm_dbscan_n_clusters" USING DM-DBSCAN-N-CLUSTERS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DBSCAN-N-CLUSTERS-RESULT TO N-CLUSTERS INT-1
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-DBSCAN-N-NOISE-SELF
    CALL "dm_dbscan_n_noise" USING DM-DBSCAN-N-NOISE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DBSCAN-N-NOISE-RESULT TO INT-2
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-DBSCAN-OBSERVATIONS-SELF
    CALL "dm_dbscan_observations" USING DM-DBSCAN-OBSERVATIONS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DBSCAN-OBSERVATIONS-RESULT TO INT-3
    DISPLAY "Clusters found: " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-1) ", noise points: " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-2)
        " (of " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-3) ")"
    *> DBSCAN labels are std::vector<int>, with -1 for noise.
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-DBSCAN-LABELS-SELF
    CALL "dm_dbscan_labels" USING DM-DBSCAN-LABELS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DBSCAN-LABELS-RESULT TO DM-VECTOR-INT-TABLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_vector_int_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-INT-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-ROWS
        MOVE DM-VECTOR-INT-TABLE-ITEM(I) TO ROW-LABEL(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE DM-DBSCAN-LABELS-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM REPORT-PURITY
    PERFORM CLOSE-MODEL

    MOVE FEATURES TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> Reads each row's Species into ROW-SPECIES, numbering species by first appearance.
READ-SPECIES.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO N-ROWS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-ROWS
        COMPUTE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX = I - 1
        CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > SPECIES-COUNT
            OR SPECIES-NAME(J) = DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH)
            CONTINUE
        END-PERFORM
        IF J > SPECIES-COUNT
            ADD 1 TO SPECIES-COUNT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH)
                TO SPECIES-NAME(J)
        END-IF
        MOVE J TO ROW-SPECIES(I)
    END-PERFORM.

*> Builds an agglomerative model of 3 clusters with the linkage already set.
NEW-AGGLOMERATIVE.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-DATA
    MOVE FEATURES TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-FEATURE-COLUMNS
    MOVE 4 TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE 3 TO DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-N-CLUSTERS
    CALL "dm_agglomerative_clustering_new" USING DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-AGGLOMERATIVE-CLUSTERING-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL.

*> Copies the VECTOR-ULONG LABELS-VEC into ROW-LABEL and closes it.
READ-ULONG-LABELS.
    MOVE LABELS-VEC TO DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_vector_ulong_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-ROWS
        MOVE DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-ITEM(I) TO ROW-LABEL(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE LABELS-VEC TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Prints each cluster's size and majority species.
REPORT-PURITY.
    INITIALIZE VOTES
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-ROWS
        IF ROW-LABEL(I) >= 0
            ADD 1 TO VOTE(ROW-LABEL(I) + 1, ROW-SPECIES(I))
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING CLUSTER FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL CLUSTER > N-CLUSTERS
        MOVE 0 TO TOTAL
        MOVE -1 TO BEST
        PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > SPECIES-COUNT
            ADD VOTE(CLUSTER, J) TO TOTAL
            IF VOTE(CLUSTER, J) > BEST
                MOVE VOTE(CLUSTER, J) TO BEST
                MOVE J TO BEST-SPECIES
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
        IF TOTAL > 0
            COMPUTE INT-1 = CLUSTER - 1
            MOVE TOTAL TO INT-2
            MOVE BEST TO INT-3
            DISPLAY "  cluster " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-1) ": " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-2)
                " points, majority " FUNCTION TRIM(SPECIES-NAME(BEST-SPECIES))
                " (" FUNCTION TRIM(INT-3) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(INT-2) ")"
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

CLOSE-MODEL.
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Formats NUM without trailing zeros into NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN).
FORMAT-NUMBER.
    COMPUTE NUM-EDIT ROUNDED = NUM
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) TO NUM-TEXT
    COMPUTE NUM-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-TEXT))
    PERFORM UNTIL NUM-TEXT(NUM-LEN:1) NOT = "0"
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM NUM-LEN
    END-PERFORM
    IF NUM-TEXT(NUM-LEN:1) = "."
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM NUM-LEN
    END-IF.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
